    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in The Holly in the Rockfield development in the heart of Dundrum, the property measures approximately 74sqm and has a south-west facing dual aspect. The light filled open plan living room and dining area comes with an electric fireplace. Double doors open onto the balcony overlooking manicured gardens. There are two generous sized double bedrooms with the master en suite. Main bathroom. One designated parking space. Gas fired central heating. \n\nRockfield, a secure gated development is superbly located within a two to three minute walk of an entire range of amenities within Dundrum Town Centre. It is positioned directly beside the Balally LUAS with the Dundrum LUAS at the opposite end of Dundrum village.The M50 motorway is within a 5 minute drive. There are excellent schools and colleges in the area.\n\nIf you wish to schedule a viewing, please contact us at info@clareconnolly.ie"
      },
